config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_264_SOCIAL_CUE
	bool "VelaSight social-cue state machine (mock closed loop)"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable the social_cue NSH command: runs the表情线索 flow
		idle -> capturing -> analyzing -> notifying -> cancelled with a real
		camera frame and a mocked cloud response.

		This is the week-4 deliverable and the documented fallback for a
		board whose network is not up yet: the Agent state flow and the
		confidence policy can be demonstrated, and every refusal branch
		(low confidence, no face, conflicting cues) can be triggered on
		demand with 'social_cue case <n>' instead of waited for.

		It also carries the skill document: 'social_cue install' writes
		social-cue-assistant.md into the agent's skills directory, which is
		the only way to get a file onto this board.
